@startuml Mo_RPG_Hero_Audio

title Mo RPG Hero — Audio Architecture UML

package "Game Events" {
  [Combat Events]
  [World/Zone Events]
  [Quest Events]
  [UI Events]
  [Multiplayer Events]
}

package "Audio Runtime" {
  [Audio Manager]
  [Music Director]
  [SFX Player]
  [Ambient Director]
  [Voice Player]
  [Audio Settings]
}

package "Audio Content" {
  [Title Loop — 60s]
  [Menu Music]
  [Biome/Zone Tracks]
  [Dungeon/Trial/Raid Tracks]
  [Boss Themes]
  [Combat SFX]
  [UI SFX]
  [Environment SFX]
  [Voice Assets]
}

[Combat Events] --> [SFX Player]
[Combat Events] --> [Music Director]
[World/Zone Events] --> [Music Director]
[World/Zone Events] --> [Ambient Director]
[Quest Events] --> [Music Director]
[UI Events] --> [SFX Player]
[Multiplayer Events] --> [SFX Player]

[Audio Settings] --> [Audio Manager]
[Audio Manager] --> [Music Director]
[Audio Manager] --> [SFX Player]
[Audio Manager] --> [Ambient Director]
[Audio Manager] --> [Voice Player]

[Music Director] --> [Title Loop — 60s]
[Music Director] --> [Menu Music]
[Music Director] --> [Biome/Zone Tracks]
[Music Director] --> [Dungeon/Trial/Raid Tracks]
[Music Director] --> [Boss Themes]
[SFX Player] --> [Combat SFX]
[SFX Player] --> [UI SFX]
[Ambient Director] --> [Environment SFX]
[Voice Player] --> [Voice Assets]

note right of [Title Loop — 60s]
Designed for seamless looping:
60 seconds, no audible gap at
loop boundary.
end note
@enduml
